{
    "title": "Magic Cross Stitch: Pixel Art",
    "description": "<h1><b>\ud83c\udfa8 Coloring by number & Pixel Art game</b> \ud83c\udfa8 </h1> \r\nFree to play adult coloring and drawing book. Fun and <i>relaxing app</i>. Start Drawing & Coloring right now! Cross Stitching on your phone anytime and anywhere!\r\n\r\nWelcome to the <b>Cross Stitch color by number game</b>! Color by number pixel arts matching numbers pixel by pixel to blow your stress away! It\u2019s really easy, choose suitable color and tap color to the right place. Pixel Art games is more than just a <i>coloring book for adults</i> it\u2019s a sewing game - the best <i>color therapy for everybody</i>!\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605 In Magic Cross Stitch game you can: \u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Choose among an extensive variety of <b>coloring pictures for both adults and kids</b>! It\u2019s a sewing game. <i>Stitch and Color by number Mandalas, Animals, Unicorns, Sweets and other free coloring pages</i>.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Enjoy easy gameplay.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Experiment with the color palette.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Improve your painting and stitching skills!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate pictures with stickers.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8  Calm and relaxing background music and sounds.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Share your embroideries with friends on social media or save them to your phone!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Relax, color and get daily bonuses and gifts!\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Magic Cross Stitch is a great coloring book for adults to relax and get rid of everyday stress!</b></h2> It\u2019s a Color art therapy and stress relief in your pocket. Enjoy the addictive coloring game. Drawing & Coloring for glory. You don't need wifi to start. Color and recolor the blank coloring pages online or offline.Our coloring app is updated from time to time, with simple and complicated designs for people of all ages.\r\n\r\nContact us at support_mcs@zimad.com with any issues, questions or comments. We would love to hear from you! \ud83d\udc9d\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605 SUBSCRIPTION \u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605</b>\r\n\r\nUpon subscribing, you will immediately receive free access to the game. Full collection of coloring books and pixel art pages! A subscription to the <i>coloring by number game</i> also allows you to create unlimited amount of your own user-created <i>pixel art pictures</i> and turns off ads in the game.\r\n\r\n\u2b50Terms of Use and Privacy Policy: https://zimad.com/policy/\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1><b>\ud83c\udfa8 Coloring by number &amp; Pixel Art game</b> \ud83c\udfa8 </h1> <br>Free to play adult coloring and drawing book. Fun and <i>relaxing app</i>. Start Drawing &amp; Coloring right now! Cross Stitching on your phone anytime and anywhere!<br><br>Welcome to the <b>Cross Stitch color by number game</b>! Color by number pixel arts matching numbers pixel by pixel to blow your stress away! It\u2019s really easy, choose suitable color and tap color to the right place. Pixel Art games is more than just a <i>coloring book for adults</i> it\u2019s a sewing game - the best <i>color therapy for everybody</i>!<br><br><b>\u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605 In Magic Cross Stitch game you can: \u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605</b><br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Choose among an extensive variety of <b>coloring pictures for both adults and kids</b>! It\u2019s a sewing game. <i>Stitch and Color by number Mandalas, Animals, Unicorns, Sweets and other free coloring pages</i>.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Enjoy easy gameplay.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Experiment with the color palette.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Improve your painting and stitching skills!<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate pictures with stickers.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8  Calm and relaxing background music and sounds.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Share your embroideries with friends on social media or save them to your phone!<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Relax, color and get daily bonuses and gifts!<br><br><h2><b>Magic Cross Stitch is a great coloring book for adults to relax and get rid of everyday stress!</b></h2> It\u2019s a Color art therapy and stress relief in your pocket. Enjoy the addictive coloring game. Drawing &amp; Coloring for glory. You don&#39;t need wifi to start. Color and recolor the blank coloring pages online or offline.Our coloring app is updated from time to time, with simple and complicated designs for people of all ages.<br><br>Contact us at support_mcs@zimad.com with any issues, questions or comments. We would love to hear from you! \ud83d\udc9d<br><br><b>\u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605 SUBSCRIPTION \u2605\ud83c\udfc6\u2605</b><br><br>Upon subscribing, you will immediately receive free access to the game. Full collection of coloring books and pixel art pages! A subscription to the <i>coloring by number game</i> also allows you to create unlimited amount of your own user-created <i>pixel art pictures</i> and turns off ads in the game.<br><br>\u2b50Terms of Use and Privacy Policy: https://zimad.com/policy/&quot;",
